#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/syscalls.2:1299
msgid ""
"is a variant of B<adjtimex>(2)  that uses I<struct\\ timeval32>, for "
"compatibility with OSF/1."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/syscalls.2:1309
msgid ""
"returns a pair of UID and effective UID via registers B<r0> and B<r20>; it "
"is provided instead of B<getuid>(2)  and B<geteuid>(2)."
msgstr ""

